    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/10b934b4a01d1535d727e7831aae44b7.poster.avif?t=1709275943\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/10b934b4a01d1535d727e7831aae44b7.webm?t=1709275943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/10b934b4a01d1535d727e7831aae44b7.mp4?t=1709275943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/8fc43ad7db2655354dffe29e9130a9b6.poster.avif?t=1709275943\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/8fc43ad7db2655354dffe29e9130a9b6.webm?t=1709275943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/8fc43ad7db2655354dffe29e9130a9b6.mp4?t=1709275943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Plunge into a <strong>puzzling exploration</strong><br>of an unfortunate and tragic situation.<br><strong>Dodge</strong> vicious chickens and tough bosses,<br>and suffer a cornucopia of painful losses,<br>as you venture deep inside<br>in a castle where the mad reside.<br><br>Explore <strong>narration filled with rhyme</strong><br>and a 3-bit artstyle worth your time.<br>Expect tentacles and weird things,<br>drama, heartbreak, and golden rings,<br>menacing voices from the dark abyss,<br>and the reaper\u2019s chilling kiss.<br><br>Venture through \u0430 short epic of grand proportions,<br>and lose yourself into the mind\u2019s twisted distortions.<br>Among the <strong>bullet hell</strong> be cautious or be bold<br>to decide how the story will unfold,<br>but be warned there is no combat and there are no guns,<br>your skills in dodging will make or break your runs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/e8512778bc538e0ed76224ab8daa0ac4.avif?t=1709275943\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/59ba4c05005601ff54af5d6247be6d04.avif?t=1709275943\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong>:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A plethora of hand-crafted puzzles.<br></li><li>Challenging boss encounters testing your planning and observation skills.<br></li><li>A story from the depths of the abyss.<br></li><li>All dialogue and narration is fully-voiced and written in rhyme.<br></li><li>Speedrunning and scoring based on number of moves (and deaths) to finish the game.<br></li><li>A keyboard or a gamepad is all you need. Let the mouse rest!<br></li><li>Cubes and chickens. Spiders too!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/57fa50186c358b9ab82305a186b30f59.poster.avif?t=1709275943\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/57fa50186c358b9ab82305a186b30f59.webm?t=1709275943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823900/extras/57fa50186c358b9ab82305a186b30f59.mp4?t=1709275943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
